        "The logistic regression model beat the counting benchmark on test years it was not trained on: its mean log loss is lower and the 95% interval of the difference lies below zero.",
        "It also beat always guessing the training years' average chance (no skill): the 95% interval of that difference lies below zero too.",
        "The model was chosen from three candidates on these same test years, so its scores may be slightly optimistic.",
        "Rain comes from 1 NASA POWER grid cell (about 55 km across) for 22 barangays, so barangays in one cell share the same rain and small storms can be missed.",
        "The records come from news reports, so an empty barangay-day means nothing was reported, not that nothing happened: the chances describe reported floods and read lower than the true rate."
      ]
